                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", which is directly after the document title. For documents that have the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "book"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " doctype, the TOC is inserted using discrete pages between the title page and the first page of content. This same behavior is used for all other doctypes if the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "title-page"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
